  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 45 - 5 + 96 ÷ 8 × 24 = 9.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and -\n\nGiven: 45 - 5 + 96 ÷ 8 × 24 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get;\n\n⇒ __**45 ÷ 5**__ + 96 - 8 × 24 = 9\n\n⇒ 9 + 96 - __**8 × 24**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __**9 + 96**__ - 192 = 9\n\n⇒ __102____ - 192__ = 9\n\n⇒ -90 ≠ 9\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) + and × **\n\nGiven: 45 - 5 + 96 ÷ 8 × 24 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 45 - 5 × __**96 ÷ 8**__ + 24 = 9\n\n⇒ 45 - __**5 **____**× **____12__ + 24 = 9\n\n⇒ __**45**__ - 60 __**+ 24**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __69** - 60**__ = 9\n\n⇒ **9 = 9**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) + and -\n\nGiven: 45 - 5 + 96 ÷ 8 × 24 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 45 + 5 - __**96 ÷ 8**__ × 24 = 9\n\n⇒ 45 + 5 - __**12 × 24**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __**45 + 5**__ - 288 = 9\n\n⇒ __50 - 288__ = 9\n\n⇒ -238 ≠ 9\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) × and - \n\nGiven: 45 - 5 + 96 ÷ 8 × 24 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 45 × 5 + __**96 ÷ 8**__ - 24 = 9\n\n⇒ __**45 × 5**__ + 12 - 24 = 9\n\n⇒ __**22**____**5 + 12**__ - 24 = 9\n\n⇒ __237____ - 24__ = 9\n\n⇒ 213 ≠ 9\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
